Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:57:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: AC, smart bracket and percent keys in the empty pad
 cells

- Operator pad (two columns): AC (always clears) and "( )" (closes an open
  bracket after a number, constant, ")" or postfix operator, opens one
  otherwise) in the two cells under DEL
- Number pad: % in the cell "=" leaves when "=" sits in the operator
  column (shown only in those size buckets)
- versionCode 39

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
